        "locator": "title and description",
        "excerpt": "issue (cited in the notes as #22665): status.health.lastTransitionTime is missing [closed; labels bug]\n**Describe the bug**\n\nThe `status.health.lastTransitionTime` field of Application is missing/not set.\n\n**To Reproduce**\n\nCreate a \"guestbook\" app, look at the status.\n\n**Expected behavior**\n\nThe field should be set.\n\n**Version**\n\ne72ebb009 (3.0)",
