        "locator": "title and description",
        "excerpt": "PR (cited in the notes as #22666): fix(controller): always set health.status.lastTransitionTime (#22665) [closed]\nFixes #22665\n\nI think the lastTransitionTime was erroneously gated behind persistResourceHealth when persistResourceHealth was disabled by default for 3.0.\n\nResource-specific health shouldn't be persisted by default, but app-level health should be. lastTransitionTime is only updated when the app health is updated.",
